<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-MINALI WINS TOUR OF SPAIN EIGHTH STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MINALI WINS TOUR OF SPAIN EIGHTH STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>JEREZ, Spain 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nicola Minali of Italy won the 220-km eighth stage of the Tour of Spain between Marbella and Jerez on Saturday.</p>
<p>Fabio Baldato of Italy retained the leaders yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
